  "description": "Gwangsu Seong, a 27-year-old young man who ended up running into dept four times after starting the bussiness with his youthful ambition. I thought it was really over, but the last change is here. The owner of a Jjamppong restaurant called the ´god of business´ in Yeongdong Market. I’m trying to earn something from underneath… “I’m not raising such a discipline, so get out of it!” Isn’t this grandmother’s personality unusual?! But I will never give up! Can you learn the secret Jjamppong recipe and succeed this time? Self-employment survival story of struggling business beginers.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%85%BC%ED%98%84%EB%8F%99-%EC%9E%A5%EC%82%AC%EA%BE%BC/1981), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55146469)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/102002)",
